.BLACKSMITH.BLACKSMITHS.BLACKSMITHING.
A person skilled in forging iron items is called a blacksmith.
To make an usable item the blacksmith needs to fully understand the way the item will be used.
So, most of the blacksmiths produce the basic tools needed for the every day life of their local culture.
The few highly skilled blacksmiths can forge more demanding iron works, like a sword.
Such a master blacksmith is a highly valued member of their community.<br>
<br>
   A blacksmith is mostly concerned with supplying their local community, but they can also produce items on demand.
You can talk to a blacksmith to ask what items they can do, and to place an order.
Depending on the item it will take from days to a month for the blacksmith to complete your order.
All the tribes of The UnReal World know how to process iron. 
***


