.PIKE.PIKES.
Pike is a common predatory fish living in the inland lakes.
It is one of the largest fish in the whole unreal world and thus a valuable catch for a fisherman.<br>
<br>
Pikes spawn in early spring, after the lake ice has melted and aquatic vegetation
starts to grow. This usually happens between late swidden month to early seedtime month. 
Pikes gather to spawn at vegetation rich, shallow shoreline waters and people take advantage of this by
fishing them with tridents and spears or even with a lippo. Spawning pikes are easily spotted in the shallow
waters and can be speared or scooped into a lippo from the shore.<br>
<br>
In addition to fishing the spawning pikes, they can be caught thorough the year with
nets or using a fishing rod - especially if a smaller fish is used as bait. With good luck, spear fishing in
shallow waters regardless of the time of the year, may sometimes provide a lone roaming pike.
