.TOOLS.
There are several special items in the game which are commonly called tools. Their use varies widely as does the method of application.<br>
Some of the tools are used manually by using [a]pply command, and some are required upon crafting or building something.<br>
The most common tools are described here:<br>
<br>
 TRAPS, 
 PUNT, PADDLE, SESTA, <br>
 NET, NETTING NEEDLE, FISHING ROD, FISHHOOK, LIPPO,<br>
 SEWING NEEDLE, TORCH, SHINGLE, SHOVEL, GRAINFLAIL, <br>
 POT, BIRCH-BARK POT, WOODEN CANTEEN, <br>
 SKIS, SKI POLE, <br>
 VASTA, <br>
 SPINDLE.<br>
